# Proto names and tags

- Name each RPC with a verb and its object, e.g. `CloseProject(CloseProjectRequest) returns (CloseProjectResponse)`. Give each operation its own request and response, including operations with no fields. Streaming RPCs use the same names for their streamed messages.
- Fields: `snake_case`.
- Append new field numbers. Never reuse or renumber.
- Choose the C# namespace from the published contract package and bounded context. Keep it stable across files in that contract.

```protobuf
syntax = "proto3";
package catalog.v1;
option csharp_namespace = "Catalog.Contracts.V1";

service Catalog {
  // Создаёт запись
  rpc CreateItem (CreateItemRequest) returns (CreateItemResponse);
}

// Данные новой записи
message CreateItemRequest {
  // Название записи
  string name = 1;
}

// Результат создания записи
message CreateItemResponse {
  // Идентификатор записи
  string id = 1;
}
```
